ing outdoors. Those children are represented by the two dots below the horizontal line.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-133622-e-2\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-133622-e-2\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"</p>\n</div>",
